<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch state to launch 5.75 pct 2007 bond.</title>
<headline>Dutch state to launch 5.75 pct 2007 bond.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the Dutch Finance Ministry:</p>
<p>ISSUER: State of the Netherlands</p>
<p>MATURITY: 15 February 2007</p>
<p>COUPON: 5.75 pct</p>
<p>AMOUNT: To be determined by tap sales.</p>
<p>PAYMENT FREQUENCY: Annual.</p>
<p>START OF TAP SALES: January 20.</p>
<p>NOTES: Tap sales will be held daily from 0800 GMT until further notice.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
